 "notes": [
  "No split line in this episode (S7 remap): no cut_on_word.",
  "Beat silences: tail.s09 36 holds Kiran 1.2 s after l29 while she waits for his answer (b3 silent_seconds 1.2 after; S7 put l29 on the silent-after frame). Silent shots use their planned duration_s (s03, s04, s12, s13, s18, s26, s27, s29, s30, s39).",
  "l09 is a hard-cut take ending on 'रहा'/'He' (S10 review): cutoffs l09 run 2, next_lead 2, so the cut to s15 and Kiran's l10 land on Billu's last syllable.",
  "tail.s32 30: room for sfx_s1a01_paan_cough after l22's laugh before Chhoti's l23.",
  "voice_fx: 'speaker' (250-5000 Hz band-pass, light tanh saturation, 14 ms reflection) on l02, Mausi on Kiran's speaker in the bedroom; the built-in 'phone' chain on l17 and l19, Mausi on Billu's phone in the car; 'stairwell', a light two-tap concrete echo (31 and 53 ms at 0.14 and 0.08), on l09-l12. All loudness-matched to the clean take; not listened to. The bureau lines are dry.",
  "Levels set against the files' measured levels and the s1e01/s1e02 conventions (beds near the bedroom bed's -46 dB mean; mus_bed_drone -24 in b3/b5, -26 in the car, -28 in the bureau; mus_road_pluck -18, peaks about -19 dB). The cue sheet's level_db values are read as relative starting points, not absolute gains. Not listened to.",
  "Bed ducking: no per-line bed dips beyond those the cue sheet singles out (l02 -4 dB; car bed -6 under l13-l16 and -12 under l17-l19; bureau bed -14 and the street layer muted under l27-l28). Music ducks under every line through the timeline's ducking (-8 dB); road pluck and drone go a further -6 / -4 dB under l17-l19.",
  "b9: the engine-off shudder is set about 0.3 s after l20 by trimming the idle file (trim expression); the car door clunk 0.4 s into s29; sfx_shutter_up starts 1.3 s into s29 and stops (file 2.8 s) about 2.1 s into s30, with Mausi in the shutter. mus_road_pluck and the drone stop dead (1 frame) on the shutter's first frame.",
  "Ending: the timeline cuts audio hard at the picture end, so the last glass-bangle chink is placed 0.5 s before the s39 cut, with the bureau bed, street layer and drone out a frame before it; the chink rings 0.5 s alone, then black. sfx_chooda_click sits in the s39 hold (0.9 s in), not under l28.",
  "sfx_almirah_door is left unplaced (optional on the cue sheet, 'only if the shot shows the door moving'; s10 is a still with the door already open). sfx_birds_dawn_loop tails 1 s into b10, as the cue sheet allows.",
  "s28 is a slate: attempt 1 rejected (hand sides and henna); attempt 2 is on disk with no review row. su1 is therefore drawn over the slate (meta.checks.supers). It stays where S7 put it; once s28's retake is approved it sits on the picture.",
  "s30: its only review row says attempt 1 approved, but manifest attempt 1 failed (no image) and the png on disk is attempt 2, so the build lists it as an unchecked take and shows it.",
  "Plot overlays (caller name and 2:00 on s02, 3:00 on s13, 'मौसी' on Billu's phone in s23) are not drawn: there are no overlay images and the overlay layer is still open in the toolchain."
 ]
